      "name": "Cabbage aphid pest/crop context",
      "description": "OCSM-conformant JSON-LD records for the cabbage aphid (BRVCBR, Brevicoryne brassicae) on Brassica oleracea, the primary pest and crop pair of the BugFinderAI pest-session pipeline, and for powdery mildew of grape (UNCINE, Uncinula necator) on Vitis vinifera as a second pair. The pipeline's session orchestrator composes the session's pest-and-crop context in these terms.",
      "version": "1.0.0",
